          <Pad Id="PW7szf2uK4lwciyOmwdtHU" Bounds="720,790,300,75" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="which piece covers the point? Contains (chapter 03) over the index. EVERYTHING that reads the match lives inside the Keep loop: no match, nothing runs - so an empty answer stays an ANSWER (Count 0) and can never become a null exploding downstream. The GetSlices have defaults for the same reason.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
